744 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Accurate housing price prediction is a fundamental challenge in real estate analytics and machine learning\056 Property values are influenced by multiple factors\054 including neighborhood characteristics\054 environmental conditions\054 accessibility\054 and socioeconomic indicators\056 The Boston Housing dataset serves as a benchmark dataset for regression tasks\054 providing valuable information about residential areas in Boston\056 This project evaluates and compares different machine learning models\054 including MLP\054 SVR\054 Random Forest\054 and XGBoost\054 to predict median house values\056 Model performance was assessed using standard regression metrics to determine the most effective approach for this prediction problem\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 743 0 R
     /Pg 722 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

